## Key Learning

- Generate every unique combination using `i < j < k`.
- Sort each triplet before storing it in the `HashSet`.
- `HashSet` removes duplicate triplets automatically.
- Convert the `HashSet` into an `ArrayList` before returning the result because the method returns `List<List<Integer>>`.

